    <panel_attributes>Present → displayedId + ResultFormatter.format → ReportText.format; enable export.
Empty → “No current report”; export disabled. Showing never calls Gemini.
Visible 250 ms timer checks current ID; obsolete display is cleared and export disabled.
fontsize=24
bg=white</panel_attributes>
